# Editor layout: Preview first

## Decision

The screen editor ships **one** shell: Preview first (canvas-first). Do **not** reintroduce a layout switcher or parallel Classic / Insert-Layers / Side-activities shells unless the user explicitly asks to experiment again.

## Structure

| Piece | Role |
|-------|------|
| [`ScreenEditor.vue`](editor/src/components/ScreenEditor.vue) | State: history, device, save/preview, page CRUD, selection, `railTool` |
| [`EditorToolbar.vue`](editor/src/components/EditorToolbar.vue) | Back, name, undo/redo, Day/Dark, device, grid size, Preview, Save |
| [`layouts/EditorLayoutCanvas.vue`](editor/src/components/layouts/EditorLayoutCanvas.vue) | Left rail (Add / Tree / Page / Screen), page picker, canvas, selection overlay |
| [`layouts/EditorCanvasSection.vue`](editor/src/components/layouts/EditorCanvasSection.vue) | Free-form Design/Split/Code + `DesignCanvas`/`CodeView`, or grid `GridMockup` |

Panels stay as shared children: `ComponentPalette`, `ComponentTree`, `EntityLibrary`, `PagePanel`, `ScreenPanel`, `AttributesPanel`, `TileDrawer`.

## UX rules for this shell

- **Rail** opens a labeled flyout (title + short blurb + close). Toggle the same button to collapse.
- **Tree** is free-form only; disabled on grid pages with a clear title.
- **Add** = palette (free-form, includes HA tab) or `EntityLibrary` (grid).
- **Selection** opens a right overlay over the preview (“Selected …” + close). Esc clears selection.
- When nothing is selected and no flyout is open, show the canvas tip pointing at Add / click-to-select.
- Page chrome: “Editing” dropdown + Free-form/Grid badge; buttons to add free-form or grid pages.

## Removed on purpose

These were A/B prototypes and should stay gone unless revived deliberately:

- Layout dropdown / `rs.editorLayout` / `editorLayout.ts`
- `EditorLayoutCurrent`, `EditorLayoutLayers`, `EditorLayoutRail`
- `PageTabs` as the primary page switcher (pages live in the canvas layout row)
- `InspectorDock` / pinned Page-Screen strip / `EditorStatusBar` layout hints

## Local run (layout work)

```sh
./gradlew :server:installDist
# terminal 1 — demo API
REMOTE_SCREENS_DEMO=1 REMOTE_SCREENS_DATA=/tmp/rs-demo \
REMOTE_SCREENS_STATIC=editor/dist \
REMOTE_SCREENS_INGRESS_PORT=18099 REMOTE_SCREENS_PLAYER_PORT=18100 \
server/build/install/server/bin/server

# terminal 2
cd editor && npm run dev
```

